# Rust build artifacts
**/target/
# Cargo.lock IS committed (these are applications, so lock for reproducible builds)

# C++ / CMake build artifacts
**/build/
**/build_ort/
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.dylib
*.so
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/

# Model weights — one root for the whole repo: models/{stt,tts,llm,vad,dfn3}.
# Downloaded via download_models.sh, mounted as a volume; never committed (the
# LLM alone is ~14 GB). `**/models/` also covers any stray per-crate model dir.
**/models/
*.onnx
*.bin
!models/.gitkeep

